flowchart LR
    subgraph compile[A. Compile]
        source[Verified sources]
        compiler[YVEX compiler]
        artifact[Identity-bound GGUF<br/>+ runtime binding]
        source --> compiler --> artifact
    end

    subgraph host[B. Run — yvexd]
        protocol[Private local protocol]
        sessions[Session registry<br/>+ persistent KV]
        worker[Bounded model worker]
        events[Typed runtime events]
        protocol <--> sessions
        sessions <--> worker
        worker --> events
    end

    subgraph execution[C. Execute]
        graph[Runtime graph]
        backend[CPU / CUDA]
        state[Transactional state]
        graph --> backend --> state
    end

    subgraph interact[D. Interact]
        raw[Raw trace]
        watch[Engine watch]
        chat[REPL / chat]
        run[yvex run]
        gateway[yvex-openai]
        apps[SDKs / applications]
    end

    artifact --> worker
    worker <--> graph
    events --> raw
    events --> watch
    protocol <--> chat
    protocol <--> run
    protocol <--> gateway <--> apps

    dev[yvex-dev<br/>engineering tools]
    dev -.-> compiler
    dev -.-> artifact
